     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p>The IP00C251 is a versatile 4K 3-channel Cross Point Switch LSI designed for efficient high-speed image signal routing. It integrates V-by-One® HS/LVDS Tx and Rx interfaces in a single chip, making it ideal for connecting high-speed image signals among multiple chips, including FPGAs. This Cross Point Switch LSI supports conversion between V-by-One® HS and LVDS, split/select image signals, and overlay/chromakey processing on synchronized 3-channel input images, synthesizing them into one channel. The device handles 4K60Hz input/output on three ports, employs a 3x3 Cross Point Switch for seamless signal routing, and offers genlock synchronization. Its resolution conversion, image correction, and CPU interface enhance flexibility. Operating on 3.3V/2.5V/1.1V, the compact BGA package ensures integration ease. The IP00C251 finds applications in advanced signal routing, FPGA-based systems, and image synthesis for video production and broadcasting.</p>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    },
